{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Laniahu, mais kutun hai asinuum, na’asaas kau’isa i?",
                "textCh": "Laniahu，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65651/918343",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "nataskun a saikin mais kutunin mas Maia kausian vanglaz, mapaklang mas cici. aat kasu i?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和MMaia去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65651/918344",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "masial mais ta’azaun, adu mahtuik amin taskun i?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65651/918345",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ngausa’ang tahu mas cina.",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65651/918346",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "cina! adu mahtuik taskun mas tuhasnanaz kausian vanglaz i?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65651/918347",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "mahtu! haitu mananulua a kamu hai",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65651/918348",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "mahtu, namaupacia a kaimin",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65651/918349",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
